/P 1320 0 R
/ActualText (Yoga: Certain yoga poses, such as twists, forward folds, and gentle inversions, help stimulate digestion by massaging the internal organs, increasing blood flow to the digestive tract, and promoting bowel regularity. Poses like Pavanamuktasana \(Wind-Relieving Pose\) and Malasana \(Garland Pose\) can alleviate bloating and aid in digestion.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
853 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
