/P 1321 0 R
/ActualText (Meditation: Meditation promotes a relaxed state of mind, reducing the production of stress hormones that negatively impact gut health. Regular meditation helps decrease inflammation, improve gut motility, and create a more balanced gut microbiome by reducing stress-related symptoms like irritable bowel syndrome \(IBS\).)
/Alt ()
/Pg 55 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
