/P 1338 0 R
/ActualText (For Diarrhea: Bananas, rice, applesauce, and toast \(BRAT diet\) are simple foods that help bulk up stool and are gentle on the stomach. Drinking an electrolyte-rich homemade solution with water, salt, and a bit of honey can help prevent dehydration.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 58 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
