/ActualText (Identify Your Gut Health Goals: Determine your specific goals \(such as reducing bloating, improving regularity, or supporting immunity\) and design your diet to support these. For instance, if you experience bloating, you may want to avoid trigger foods like beans, carbonated drinks, and certain cruciferous vegetables.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
896 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1347 0 R
/ActualText (Include Gut-Friendly Foods: Incorporate a variety of prebiotics \(like garlic, onions, asparagus, and bananas\) and probiotics \(such as yogurt, kefir, and kimchi\) that support the gut microbiome. Balance these with a variety of fruits, vegetables, whole grains, and lean proteins.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
897 0 obj
